      "title": "CISCE announces 2027 board exam dates; ICSE from Feb 15, ISC from Feb 9",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/education/news/cisce-announces-2027-board-exam-dates-icse-from-feb-15-isc-from-feb-9-126111000424_1.html",
      "description": "The Council for the Indian School Certificate Examinations (CISCE) on Tuesday announced the schedule for the 2027 board exams, with class 10 and 12 exams set to begin from Feb 15 and 9, respectively.\nA total of 3,79,980 candidates will appear for the two examinations. The ICSE (class 10) examination will see 2.70 lakh candidates from 3,106 affiliated schools, while more than 1.1 lakh candidates from 1,651 schools will appear for the ISC (class 12) examination.\nThe ICSE examination will cover 76 subjects or papers, while the ISC examination will feature 60 subjects.\n\"The ICSE year 2027 examination will commence on February 15, 2027, and conclude on March 31, 2027. The examination will be conducted across 2,835 examination centres in India and overseas.\n\"The credibility of an examination system rests on the fairness of its processes, the integrity of its administration and the confidence it inspires among students, parents and institutions,\" Joseph Emmanuel, chief executive and ...",
